            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Runic 2.15.2</h2>
<ul>
<li>SiliconFlow: if signing in through Runic's window doesn't work, which can happen with Google, you can now paste your session cookie into a new field in the SiliconFlow settings. Runic checks that it returns a balance before saving it to its own Keychain item.</li>
</ul>
<p><a href="https://github.com/sriinnu/Runic/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md">View full changelog</a></p>
]]></description>
